<h3>Verse to memorize</h3>

<div class="bible-passage">
<p>&laquo;Do you not know that your body is a temple of the Holy Spirit within you, whom you have from God? You are not your own, for you were bought with a price. So glorify God in your body.&raquo;</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; 1 Corinthians 6:19-20</p>
</div>

