<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for this week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus, you who are the model of every chaste heart,<br />
teach me to see my body as you see it: a temple, not a playground.<br />
Give me the courage to say &laquo;no&raquo; to what degrades me<br />
and &laquo;yes&raquo; to what makes me truly free.<br />
For every time I have treated another person as an object, forgive me.<br />
For every time I have given away what belonged only to love, heal me.<br />
If I am called to marriage, prepare me now to be a spouse who gives everything.<br />
If I am called to celibacy for the Kingdom, make my heart spacious enough for all.<br />
Blessed Chiara Badano, you who found joy even in cancer,<br />
pray for me, that I may learn to say with you:<br />
&laquo;For you, Jesus. If you want it, I want it too.&raquo;<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

